        "**Analyze**: Remember, the binary matrix ignores word frequency in its entirety. That is why the accuracy drops to 67.2% from somethign like 77.6% in the Naive Bayes models. Looking at category 3, we see that the kNN models has a recall of 52%. It thought that 8 of the docs that are cat 3 are actually cat 1.\n",
