        "**Analyze**: Random forest had an overall accuracy of 68%. Sentiment is hard to predict because it is human emotion rather than a topic. The chart shows a huge neutral bias, which is responsible for the 93% neutral recall (rarely misses any document which are actually neutral). However, when a model did guess that a documen was negative or positive sentiment, it was right 97% and 84% of time time respectively, which is good.\n",
        "\n",
        "This model is very cautious."
